sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant I as Interactions
    participant F as FlowState
    participant D as DirtyMarker

    Note over U,D: 流程一：拖图进画布
    U->>I: 拖入图片（历史图/文件）
    I->>I: _dropImage(src, world)
    alt 命中节点
        I->>F: addRefImage(nodeId, src)
        F->>F: refImages 去重追加 + notify
        I->>D: markStale(nodeId) 标待重跑
    else 空白处
        I->>F: addNode('image-gen', x, y, {refImages:[src]})
        F->>F: 建节点(imageUrl=null) + notify
        I->>I: selection.select + resolveDefaultModel 回填 model
    end

    Note over U,D: 流程二：运行（单节点）
    participant CP as CmdPanel
    participant RE as RunEngine
    participant Def as NodeDefinition(image-gen)
    participant B as Backend
    U->>CP: 点发送 / 右键运行
    CP->>RE: run(nodeId)
    RE->>Def: canRun(node, ctx)
    alt 不满足
        Def-->>RE: "请输入提示词" / "请先选择绘图模型"
        RE->>CP: showToast(原因)
    else 满足
        RE->>F: status='run'
        RE->>Def: buildOptions(node, ctx)
        Def->>F: getReferenceImages(node.id)
        F-->>Def: refImages ∪ 上游 imageUrl
        RE->>B: generateImage(prompt, options)
        B-->>RE: {task_id}
        RE->>RE: pollTask → {success, imageUrl}
        RE->>F: setNodeImage(nodeId, imageUrl)
        RE->>F: status='done'
        RE->>D: markUpstreamChanged(nodeId) 下游标 stale
    end

    Note over U,D: 流程三：旧项目加载迁移
    participant P as Persistence
    U->>P: open() / restore(raw)
    P->>P: 校验 format==='icv'
    P->>P: nodes.map(migrateNode)
    loop 每个节点
        alt type==='product-image'
            P->>P: type='image-gen'; refImages=[imageUrl]; imageUrl=null; status='idle'
        else style-transfer / image-gen
            P->>P: type='image-gen'; refImages 保留（空）
        end
    end
    P->>F: replaceAll({nodes, version:'3.1'})
    F->>F: notify + 全量渲染
